      <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out px-4 pb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Yes &mdash; that&rsquo;s the whole point of a private yacht charter. Tell us in advance what you&rsquo;d like (snorkel, sunset timing, quiet swim, paddleboarding, photos at the Arch) and we&rsquo;ll build the day around you. Your captain can also adjust on the water if your group changes its mind.</p>
