        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Yes. Snorkel gear is included on every yacht charter &mdash; mask, fins, and life vests in all sizes. Your captain will anchor at the best spot of the day, typically <strong>Chileno Bay</strong> or <strong>Santa Mar&iacute;a Bay</strong> &mdash; both calm, clear, and full of tropical fish. Beginners and kids are welcome; the crew helps anyone who needs it.</p>
