      <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out px-4 pb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Both &mdash; our yachts are built for groups of any age and any vibe. Shaded seating and calm spaces for kids and grandparents, plenty of deck for dancing and sunbathing. We host <a href="/bachelorette" class="text-accent-gold font-semibold hover:underline">bachelorette parties</a>, family reunions, anniversaries, birthdays, and corporate retreats every week. Bring your own decorations and playlist &mdash; we&rsquo;ll take care of the rest.</p>
