        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">If the captain determines it&rsquo;s unsafe to sail, we reschedule your charter to another date at no charge &mdash; or refund in full if you can&rsquo;t rebook. Cabo&rsquo;s weather is excellent year-round, but in the rare case of high winds or rough seas, we always prioritize safety. See our <a href="/policies" class="text-accent-gold font-semibold hover:underline">cancellation &amp; weather policies</a> for full details.</p>
