      <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out px-4 pb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">38' Sailboat &mdash; 9 guests, 42' Sailboat &mdash; 14 guests, 42' Yacht &mdash; 18 guests, 45' Yacht &mdash; 12 guests, 51' Yacht &mdash; 20 guests. The 51' is our largest, ideal for reunions and corporate trips.</p>
